1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,502
After that incident
with Hye-won

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,137
I promised myself not to
get involved with him.

3
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:06,239
Not a lot of customers
today, huh?

4
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:06,773
No.

5
00:00:06,773 --> 00:00:07,807
Just two months.

6
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:09,242
I'll go on for two months
and then quit.

7
00:00:09,242 --> 00:00:09,809
Pardon?

8
00:00:09,809 --> 00:00:10,910
20 flower bouquets?

9
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:13,218
I'll be heading off first.

10
00:00:16,082 --> 00:00:17,951
I still owe him.

11
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:19,071
It's the least I could do...

12
00:00:22,322 --> 00:00:23,890
But you have a type,
don't you?

13
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:26,459
I don't know, but I do have
a type I don't like.

14
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:28,294
The people
who approach me first.

15
00:00:28,561 --> 00:00:29,963
You're scared, aren't you?

16
00:00:29,963 --> 00:00:31,898
Don't do that to yourself.

17
00:00:31,898 --> 00:00:34,234
You're a lot better
than you think.

18
00:00:34,734 --> 00:00:36,236
Why does he keep
approaching me

19
00:00:36,236 --> 00:00:37,737
when I'm pushing him away?

20
00:00:38,938 --> 00:00:40,273
One thing's for certain.

21
00:00:42,142 --> 00:00:43,043
Get ready.

22
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:43,610
Smile.

23
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:45,412
He's a completely
different sort

24
00:00:45,412 --> 00:00:46,913
from those I've met before.

25
00:00:48,348 --> 00:00:50,216
Eun-ho's really good at this,
by the way.

26
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:52,986
Who's going to make these
for us when he quits?

27
00:00:53,053 --> 00:00:54,621
But I'm not quitting.

28
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:56,656
So I began to get curious.

29
00:00:56,656 --> 00:00:58,058
I'll keep making them for you.

30
00:00:58,525 --> 00:00:59,525
About this man.
